"Use <b>Refresh Terms</b> to load them for chosen models, modules\n"
"               or languages (leave empty for everything). Every translatable\n"
"               term is collected — Python, JavaScript, QWeb, fields, views and\n"
"               menus — whether already translated or not."
msgstr "Gamitin ang <b>Refresh Terms</b> upang i-load ang mga ito para sa piniling models, modules\n               o languages (iwanang walang laman para sa lahat). Bawat naisasaling\n               termino ay kinokolekta — Python, JavaScript, QWeb, fields, views at\n               menus — naisalin na man o hindi pa."

